    "https://www.troyuniversityjobs.com/postings/48345": {
      "title": "Academic Program Specialist",
      "description": "Troy University Employment Site | Academic Program Specialist Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Frequently Asked Questions Academic Program Specialist Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Posting Number SF2587P Position Title Academic Program Specialist Position Type Classified Staff/Hourly Department Hospitality, Sport, and Tourism Management - Troy Division Sorrell College of Business Campus Troy Work Status Full-Time (FT) Temporary No Location Troy - T01 Job Summary The Academic Program Specialist provides administrative support and manages a variety of academic and departmental processes for the School of Hospitality, Sport and Tourism Management, reporting to the Department Chair. This position is responsible for general office duties, scheduling, coordinating, and planning meetings, filing and recordkeeping, scholarship assistance, and assisting students and faculty as needed. Minimum Qualifications 1. High school diploma or equivalent. 2. Minimum of one year of customer service experience. 3. Strong interpersonal skills and the ability to collaborate effectively. 4. Excellent working knowledge of all Microsoft computer programs. 5. Organized in scheduling, record keeping, and filing. 6. Ability to multi-task and handle several projects at one time. Preferred Qualifications 1. Experience using Ellucian Colleague/Datatel. Will this position require driving (perso