hs for new employees and three months for promoted employees) * Do you have a Bachelor's degree in a related field? Yes No * Do you have a minimum of two years of related work experience? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter List of References Unofficial Transcript  1 - Employment is contingent upon a satisfactory background check. - Troy University is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. - Troy University participates in eVerify. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
