      "description": "Troy University Employment Site | Staff Accountant Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Frequently Asked Questions Staff Accountant Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Posting Number SF2586P Position Title Staff Accountant Position Type Professional/Salaried Department Controller's Office - Troy Division Finance and Administration Campus Troy Work Status Full-Time (FT) Temporary No Location Troy - T01 Job Summary The Staff Accountant position acts as accounting liaison with the Controller’s Office and other departments and external agencies with respect to financial reporting, tax reporting & compliance, journal entry preparation, audit/reconciliation of accounts, and audit of requests for payment. The position is responsible for preparing and reviewing all types of transactions in compliance with approved budgets and University/department procedures, preparation of appropriate reports as needed for analysis, corresponding with other departments concerning accounting and financial information, and determining proper handling of financial transactions in accordance with Generally Accepted Accounting Principles ( GAAP ) and approving within designated limits, policies or contracts. Minimum Qualifications 1. Bachelor’s degree in Accounting from an accredited institution Preferred Qualifications 1. Masters degree in Accounting 2. Experience in a higher education setting. Wi