    "https://www.troyuniversityjobs.com/postings/47334": {
      "title": "Academic Services Associate",
      "description": "Troy University Employment Site | Academic Services Associate Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Frequently Asked Questions Academic Services Associate Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Posting Number SF2511P Position Title Academic Services Associate Position Type Classified Staff/Hourly Department Advisement - Troy Online Division Finance and Administration Campus Troy Online Work Status Full-Time (FT) Temporary No Location Troy - T01 Job Summary The Academic Services Associate ( ASA ) position for TROY Online Academic Services is responsible for: • Assisting advisees with the planning and registering of classes. • Keeping students on track and focusing on the retention of advisees • Focusing on student engagement • Working daily CRM Alerts and Tasks related to student progression • Coordinate with ID and other areas on special projects Minimum Qualifications 1. Bachelor’s degree from an accredited university, or equivalent related work experience 2. Extensive computer knowledge 3. Proficiency in communication (verbal and written) 4. Excellent organizational skills Preferred Qualifications 1. Experience in a higher education environment 2. Knowledge of Troy University Will this position require driving (personal vehicle, university vehicle, utility vehicle, or golf cart) in order to perform the job duties? No Work Hours 8am to 5pm, Monday through Friday List any h