ence you may have: (Open Ended Question) * Please describe any related professional experience you may have: (Open Ended Question) Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter List of References Unofficial Transcript  1 Optional Documents Curriculum Vitae Teaching Philosophy Letter of Reference 1 Letter of Reference 2 Unofficial Transcript  2 Other Document - Employment is contingent upon a satisfactory background check. - Troy University is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. - Troy University participates in eVerify. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
