      "description": "Troy University Employment Site | Workship Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Frequently Asked Questions Workship Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Posting Number ST1464P Position Title Workship Position Type Student Department University Relations - Troy Division Student Affairs for Academic Affairs Campus Troy Work Status Student (SPT) Temporary No Location Troy - T01 Job Summary The Workship position in University Relations is responsible for taking photos at selected events, assisting in the collection and archiving of photos and photo releases, and assisting the Photography staff with additional duties as assigned. Minimum Qualifications 1. Must be a current Troy University student enrolled at least half-time. 2. Photography experience. Please note: Student positions are FICA /Medicare exempt only if students are enrolled in classes in the semester work is performed. To qualify for the FICA /Medicare exemption, you must be enrolled on a half-time basis for the Fall, Spring, or Summer. Preferred Qualifications Will this position require driving (personal vehicle, university vehicle, utility vehicle, or golf cart) in order to perform the job duties? No Work Hours 15 hours per week List any hazardous conditions or physical demands required by this position NA Does this position have supervisory responsibility? No Posting Date 08/11/2026 Closing Date Open Until Fil