      "title": "Graduate Teaching Assistant",
      "description": "Troy University Employment Site | Graduate Teaching Assistant Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Frequently Asked Questions Graduate Teaching Assistant Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Posting Number ST1370P Position Title Graduate Teaching Assistant Position Type Student Department Chemistry and Physics - Troy Division College of Science and Engineering Campus Troy Work Status Student (SPT) Temporary Yes Location Troy - T01 Job Summary The graduate teaching assistant will teach Physics, Physical Science, and Astronomy labs by effective delivery of the required course materials and fostering a positive learning environment for students. Minimum Qualifications 1. Must be a current Troy University student enrolled in at least six credit hours in the Master of Science in Applied Mathematical Sciences in Mathematical Physics program. Please note: Student positions are FICA /Medicare exempt only if students are enrolled in classes in the semester work is performed. To qualify for the FICA /Medicare exemption, you must be enrolled on a half-time basis for the Fall, Spring, or Summer. Preferred Qualifications Will this position require driving (personal vehicle, university vehicle, utility vehicle, or golf cart) in order to perform the job duties? Driving may be necessary but is not a primary responsibility Work Hours To be determined List any hazardous conditions or physical demands required by this position N/A Does this position have supervisory responsibility? No Posting Date 05/06/2026 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link https://www.troyuniversityjobs.com/postings/45871 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * How did you hear about this employment opportunity? Troy University employment website (www.troyuniversityjobs.com) Chronicle of Higher Education Higher Ed Jobs Social Media website Indeed Other employment website (please specify below) Employee Referral (please specify below) Local newspaper (please specify below) Professional journal (please specify below) Other source (please specify below) Please specify: (Open Ended Question) * Do you currently work in another position for Troy University? No Yes - intend to keep other position Yes - intend to resign from other position * Are you a current Troy University graduate student, or will you be a graduate student at the start of employment? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter List of References Optional Documents Unofficial Transcript  1 Unofficial Transcript  2 - Employment is contingent upon a satisfactory background check. - Troy University is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. - Troy University participates in eVerify. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
